{"unit_id": "tag:02NY:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>为整概形（integral schemes）。\n设<MATH_0003>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）且占优（dominant）的。\n假设<MATH_0004>，或假设引理<REF_0001>的等价（equivalent）条件（1）至（4）中任一其他条件成立。\n则正整数（positive integer）\n<MATH_0005>\n称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>上的度（degree）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "integral schemes", "target_term": "整概形"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "dominant", "target_term": "占优"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "positive integer", "target_term": "正整数"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "度"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "integral schemes", "target_term": "整概形", "context": "定义中所考虑的两个概形"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "所给态射的有限型条件"}, {"source_term": "dominant", "target_term": "占优", "context": "所给态射的占优条件"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "被引引理中各条件的关系"}, {"source_term": "positive integer", "target_term": "正整数", "context": "所定义的度之取值"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "度", "context": "此定义所命名的不变量"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02NV:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在下列条件下，可将这一概念推广到态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>。（a）<MATH_0002>是整的（integral），其泛点（generic point）为<MATH_0003>，（b）<MATH_0004>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的，且（c）<MATH_0005>是有限（finite）的。\n此时可以定义\n<MATH_0006>\n具体而言，由于<MATH_0007>（引理<REF_0001>），由上面的引理<REF_0002>可知，上述各维数（dimensions）均为有限（finite）的。\n不过，对大多数应用而言，前面给出的定义才是合适的。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["a", "b", "c"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "dimensions", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "这一概念所推广到的对象"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的", "context": "概形的整性条件"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点", "context": "整概形的泛点"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "推广所需的第二项条件"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "推广所需的第三项条件"}, {"source_term": "dimensions", "target_term": "维数", "context": "所给定义中涉及的维数"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "上述各维数的有限性"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02NZ:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003>为整概形（integral schemes）。\n设<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>为占优（dominant）的态射（morphisms），且均为局部有限型（locally of finite type）。\n假设<MATH_0006>且<MATH_0007>。则\n<MATH_0008>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "integral schemes", "target_term": "整概形"}, {"source_term": "dominant", "target_term": "占优"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "integral schemes", "target_term": "整概形", "context": "引理中所考虑的三个概形"}, {"source_term": "dominant", "target_term": "占优", "context": "两个态射的占优条件"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "两个给定映射的类型"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "两个态射的有限型条件"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02NZ:proof", "translation": "这是由塔（towers）中有限（finite）域（fields）扩张（extensions）的度（degrees）的乘法性（multiplicativity）得出的，见《域（Fields）》一章的引理<REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "towers", "target_term": "塔"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "fields", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "extensions", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "degrees", "target_term": "度"}, {"source_term": "multiplicativity", "target_term": "乘法性"}, {"source_term": "Fields", "target_term": "域"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "towers", "target_term": "塔", "context": "嵌套的域扩张"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "塔中各扩张的有限性"}, {"source_term": "fields", "target_term": "域", "context": "组成塔的代数结构"}, {"source_term": "extensions", "target_term": "扩张", "context": "塔中的扩张"}, {"source_term": "degrees", "target_term": "度", "context": "塔中各域扩张的度"}, {"source_term": "multiplicativity", "target_term": "乘法性", "context": "扩张的度在塔中相乘的性质"}, {"source_term": "Fields", "target_term": "域", "context": "被引的章节名称"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:073A:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个态射（morphism），其源和目标均为概形（schemes），且为局部有限型（locally of finite type）。\n至少有两种性质可以用来定义<TEXTITOPEN_0001>泛有限（generically finite）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>态射（morphisms）。这取决于希望该性质是源（source）上的局部性质，还是目标（target）上的局部性质：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>（在目标（target）上局部，由 Ravi Vakil 提出。）\n假设<MATH_0002>的每个拟紧开集（quasi-compact open）都只有有限多个（finitely many）不可约分支（irreducible components）（例如<MATH_0003>是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的情形）。要求每个泛点（generic point）的逆（inverse）像（image）是有限（finite）的，见引理<REF_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0003>（在源（source）上局部。）要求存在一个稠密开集（dense open）<MATH_0004>，使得<MATH_0005>是局部拟有限（locally quasi-finite）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n在（1）中，表述该要求时可以省去对<MATH_0006>的辅助条件，但这样对于一般的概形（schemes）可能得不到正确的概念。按上述表述，性质（2）并不蕴含泛点（generic points）上的纤维（fibres）是有限（finite）的；不过，若<MATH_0007>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的且<MATH_0008>满足（1）中的条件，则这一蕴含成立。\n", "allowed_english": ["Ravi", "Vakil"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "generically finite", "target_term": "泛有限"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "source", "target_term": "源"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集"}, {"source_term": "finitely many", "target_term": "有限多个"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "source", "target_term": "源"}, {"source_term": "dense open", "target_term": "稠密开集"}, {"source_term": "locally quasi-finite", "target_term": "局部拟有限"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": 