{"unit_id": "tag:0AAZ:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为整（integral）概形（scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0002>的修正（modification）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是一个双有理（birational）固有态射（proper morphism）<MATH_0003>，其中<MATH_0004>是整的（integral）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "modification", "target_term": "修正"}, {"source_term": "birational", "target_term": "双有理"}, {"source_term": "proper morphism", "target_term": "固有态射"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "修正所针对的概形的整性"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所给对象的类型"}, {"source_term": "modification", "target_term": "修正", "context": "此处定义的双有理固有态射"}, {"source_term": "birational", "target_term": "双有理", "context": "修正的双有理条件"}, {"source_term": "proper morphism", "target_term": "固有态射", "context": "修正所要求的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的", "context": "修正的源的整性"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02NV:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为定义中的修正（modification）。由引理<REF_0001>，存在非空（nonempty）的<MATH_0002>，使得<MATH_0003>是有限（finite）的。由泛平坦性（generic flatness）（命题<REF_0002>），可假设<MATH_0004>是平坦（flat）且有限表示（finite presentation）的。\n因此，<MATH_0005>是有限局部自由（finite locally free）的（引理<REF_0003>）。\n由于<MATH_0006>是双有理（birational）的，<MATH_0007>在<MATH_0008>上的度（degree）为<MATH_0009>。\n故<MATH_0010>是有限局部自由（finite locally free）的，度（degree）为<MATH_0011>，换言之，它是同构（isomorphism）。因此，可将修正（modification）<TEXTITOPEN_0001>重新定义<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>为整概形（integral schemes）之间的固有态射（proper morphism）<MATH_0012>，使得<MATH_0013>对于某个非空开集（nonempty open）<MATH_0014>是同构（isomorphism）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "modification", "target_term": "修正"}, {"source_term": "nonempty", "target_term": "非空"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "generic flatness", "target_term": "泛平坦性"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由"}, {"source_term": "birational", "target_term": "双有理"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "度"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "度"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "modification", "target_term": "修正"}, {"source_term": "integral schemes", "target_term": "整概形"}, {"source_term": "proper morphism", "target_term": "固有态射"}, {"source_term": "nonempty open", "target_term": "非空开集"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "modification", "target_term": "修正", "context": "定义给出的态射"}, {"source_term": "nonempty", "target_term": "非空", "context": "所取对象的非空性"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "限制后的态射的有限性"}, {"source_term": "generic flatness", "target_term": "泛平坦性", "context": "用来进一步缩小开集的命题"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "限制后的态射的平坦性"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "限制后的态射的表示条件"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由", "context": "由上述条件得出的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "birational", "target_term": "双有理", "context": "用于确定度的条件"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "度", "context": "双有理条件所确定的不变量"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由", "context": "用其度推出同构的性质"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "度", "context": "有限局部自由态射的度"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "由有限局部自由及其度所推出的结论"}, {"source_term": "modification", "target_term": "修正", "context": "将以等价条件重新定义的术语"}, {"source_term": "integral schemes", "target_term": "整概形", "context": "态射的源与目标所属的类别"}, {"source_term": "proper morphism", "target_term": "固有态射", "context": "重新定义中要求的态射类型"}, {"source_term": "nonempty open", "target_term": "非空开集", "context": "在其上要求给定限制是同构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "重新定义中限制态射所需满足的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0AB0:statement", "translation": "<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为整（integral）概形（scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0002>的变更（alteration）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是一个固有（proper）且占优（dominant）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>，其中<MATH_0004>是整的（integral），并且<MATH_0005>对于某个非空开集（nonempty open）<MATH_0006>是有限（finite）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "alteration", "target_term": "变更"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有"}, {"source_term": "dominant", "target_term": "占优"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的"}, {"source_term": "nonempty open", "target_term": "非空开集"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "变更所针对的概形的整性"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所给对象的类型"}, {"source_term": "alteration", "target_term": "变更", "context": "此处定义的占优固有态射"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有", "context": "变更所需的固有性"}, {"source_term": "dominant", "target_term": "占优", "context": "变更所需的占优性"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所定义映射的类型"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的", "context": "变更的源的整性"}, {"source_term": "nonempty open", "target_term": "非空开集", "context": "在其上要求给定限制有限"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "变更在该开集上的有限性"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02NV:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这就是<REF_0001>中给出的定义，只是这里不要求<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>是诺特（Noetherian）的。仿照上面的论证可知，变更（alteration）是整概形（integral schemes）之间固有（proper）且占优（dominant）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>，它诱导函数（function）域（fields）的有限扩张（finite extension），也就是说，引理<REF_0002>中的等价（equivalent）条件成立。\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "alteration", "target_term": "变更"}, {"source_term": "integral schemes", "target_term": "整概形"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有"}, {"source_term": "dominant", "target_term": "占优"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数"}, {"source_term": "fields", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "finite extension", "target_term": "有限扩张"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "此定义对两个概形都不作此要求"}, {"source_term": "alteration", "target_term": "变更", "context": "对前面的定义给出等价刻画"}, {"source_term": "integral schemes", "target_term": "整概形", "context": "刻画中态射的源与目标"}, {"source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有", "context": "刻画中保持的固有性要求"}, {"source_term": "dominant", "target_term": "占优", "context": "刻画中保持的占优性要求"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所刻画对象的类型"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数", "context": "指定所考虑的是概形的函数域"}, {"source_term": "fields", "target_term": "域", "context": "有限扩张所涉及的两个域"}, {"source_term": "finite extension", "target_term": "有限扩张", "context": "由该态射诱导的扩张"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "被引引理中条件之间的关系"}], "notes": []}
