{"unit_id": "tag:02JT:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n对于诺特（Noetherian）概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphisms），关于局部环（local rings）的维数（dimensions）还能再说一点。下面是一个重要的（而且不太难证明的）结果。回顾一下，<MATH_0001>表示整（integral）概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>的函数（function）域（field）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "dimensions", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Noetherian", "target_term": "诺特", "context": "关于态射的源和目标的条件"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所讨论的态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "本段所讨论的映射"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "维数公式所涉及的环"}, {"source_term": "dimensions", "target_term": "维数", "context": "所讨论的局部环的不变量"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "具有所记函数域的概形的整性"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "具有所记函数域的对象"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数", "context": "指定此处所记的域为函数域"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "此处记号表示的代数结构"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02JU:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。\n设<MATH_0002>为概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。\n取<MATH_0003>，并令<MATH_0004>。\n假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002><MATH_0005>是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的；\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0006>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的；\n<STRUCT_0004><MATH_0007>和<MATH_0008>都是整的（integral）；\n<STRUCT_0005><MATH_0009>是占优（dominant）的。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n则有\n<MATH_0010>\n此外，若<MATH_0011>是普遍悬链（universally catenary）的，则等号（equality）成立。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的"}, {"source_term": "dominant", "target_term": "占优"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍悬链"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等号"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理所给的第一个对象"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所给态射的源和目标所属的类别"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所给映射的类型"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "第一项假设"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "第二项假设"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的", "context": "第三项假设中的整性"}, {"source_term": "dominant", "target_term": "占优", "context": "第四项假设"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍悬链", "context": "使不等式取等号的条件"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等号", "context": "附加条件下不等式取等的结论"}], "notes": []}
