{"unit_id": "tag:0BAE:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。\n取<MATH_0003>，并令<MATH_0004>。假设<MATH_0005>是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的，且<MATH_0006>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的。\n则有\n<MATH_0007>\n其中<MATH_0008>是<MATH_0009>的最大值（maximum），这里<MATH_0010>遍历<MATH_0011>中包含<MATH_0012>的各不可约分支（irreducible components）的泛点（generic points）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "maximum", "target_term": "最大值"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "generic points", "target_term": "泛点"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理所给的第一个对象"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所给态射的源和目标所属的类别"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所给映射的类型"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "引理的第一项性质假设"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "引理的第二项性质假设"}, {"source_term": "maximum", "target_term": "最大值", "context": "对指定的泛点取值后得到的最大值"}, {"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "用于确定取值范围的分支"}, {"source_term": "generic points", "target_term": "泛点", "context": "取最大值时所遍历的点"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0BAE:proof", "translation": "令<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>中包含<MATH_0003>的不可约分支（irreducible components），并赋予它们约化（reduced）的诱导（induced）概形（scheme）结构（structure）。\n这些分支与极小素理想（minimal primes）<MATH_0004>对应，后者属于<MATH_0005>，因而这样的分支只有有限多个（finitely many）（见《概形（Schemes）》一章的引理<REF_0001>与《代数（Algebra）》一章的引理<REF_0002>）。\n于是\n<MATH_0006>。\n对于<MATH_0007>，定义<MATH_0008>时所取的恰为泛点（generic points）<MATH_0009>。取<MATH_0010>，赋予其约化（reduced）的诱导（induced）概形（scheme）结构（structure）。\n复合（composition）<MATH_0011>经由<MATH_0012>分解（factors through）（见《概形（Schemes）》一章的引理<REF_0003>）。因此，可应用维数公式（dimension formula）（引理<REF_0004>），得到\n<MATH_0013>。综合以上各步即得此引理。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "约化"}, {"source_term": "induced", "target_term": "诱导"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "structure", "target_term": "结构"}, {"source_term": "minimal primes", "target_term": "极小素理想"}, {"source_term": "finitely many", "target_term": "有限多个"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "generic points", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "约化"}, {"source_term": "induced", "target_term": "诱导"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "structure", "target_term": "结构"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "factors through", "target_term": "分解"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "dimension formula", "target_term": "维数公式"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "取包含给定点的分支"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "约化", "context": "所赋予结构的约化性"}, {"source_term": "induced", "target_term": "诱导", "context": "所赋予结构由原概形诱导"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所赋予结构所属的类别"}, {"source_term": "structure", "target_term": "