{"unit_id": "tag:02JT:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n一个应用是，对任一在配有维数（dimension）函数（function）的普遍悬链（universally catenary）概形（scheme）上为有限型（finite type）的概形（scheme），构造其上的维数（dimension）函数（function）。维数（dimension）函数（functions）的定义见《拓扑学（Topology）》一章的定义<REF_0001>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍悬链"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "functions", "target_term": "函数"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "基底所配函数记录的不变量"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数", "context": "在基底上给定的函数"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍悬链", "context": "对基底概形的条件"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "已经配有维数函数的基底"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "对基底上的概形要求的性质"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "构造新维数函数的对象"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "待构造的函数所记录的不变量"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数", "context": "在给定概形上待构造的函数"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "所引定义中函数涉及的不变量"}, {"source_term": "functions", "target_term": "函数", "context": "被引定义所介绍的函数"}, {"source_term": "Topology", "target_term": "拓扑学", "context": "定义所在的被引章节"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02JW:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为局部诺特（locally Noetherian）且普遍悬链（universally catenary）的概形（scheme）。\n设<MATH_0002>为一个维数（dimension）函数（function）。\n设<MATH_0003>为概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。\n假设<MATH_0004>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的。\n则映射（map）\n<MATH_0005>\n是<MATH_0006>上的维数（dimension）函数（function）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍悬链"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "基底概形的第一项条件"}, {"source_term": "universally catenary", "target_term": "普遍悬链", "context": "基底概形的第二项条件"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "开头所给的基底对象"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "已给函数所记录的不变量"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数", "context": "引理中给定的函数"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射的源和目标所属的类别"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所给映射的类型"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "给定态射的假设"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "公式所定义的映射"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "所得函数所记录的不变量"}, {"source_term": "function", "target_term": "函数", "context": "结论所确定的函数类型"}], "notes": []}
